      "id": "claim_cba941be56e4486091c533354212f33d",
      "statement": "The first implementation hardcodes exactly three approval-gated operations — submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file — and gates all other actions out; the set is centralized in ApprovalActionType and getApprovalActionType in packages/shared.",
