      "id": "claim_41cf2e51211c4c14b0abbb169b6947a9",
      "statement": "Before executing an approved action the controller re-reads the active origin and fails with approval_origin_changed if it no longer matches the origin captured at approval time; ADR 0048 specifies this origin-changed check.",
